  "ingredients": [
    "5 tablespoons salted butter",
    "5 tablespoons shortening",
    "0.75 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "2 tablespoons milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and shortening together with an electric mixer in a large bowl until light and fluffy. The mixture should be noticeably lighter in color. Beat vanilla extract into the butter mixture. Add sugar, one cup at a time, beating on medium speed until fully incorporated. Add milk, one tablespoon at a time, beating on high until fully incorporated and you have frosting.",
